  "goodToKnow": "Der Nachrichtendienst is an intelligence service; colloquially der Geheimdienst. Germany has three federal ones: the Bundesnachrichtendienst (BND, foreign intelligence, headquartered in Berlin), the Bundesamt für Verfassungsschutz (BfV, domestic) and the Militärische Abschirmdienst (MAD, military). The Parliamentary Control Panel of the Bundestag oversees them. A news agency is a Nachrichtenagentur, like dpa. Plural: die Nachrichtendienste."
